Attention all Space Helper Bots - This is an important message from the Galactic Service Unit Patrol HQ:

BIPED developer NeXT Studios and publisher META Publishing are happy to announce that the game was nominated for the 2020 Indie Of The Year Awards by IndieDB. BIPED will compete within the adventure section. Hooray!

The Galactic Service Unit Patrol has a mission for you: if you want to help us bring the award home, you can cast your vote for BIPED on IndieDB’s official website. By supporting BIPED, you’ll also get a chance to win 1 of 15 copies of the game on your favorite platform. 

Here’s what you should do to join the giveaway:

 Visit the 2020 Indie Of The Year Awards page at this address;
 Click the “Vote” button next to BIPED and snap a screenshot;
 Save your screenshot as an image, making sure to remove all sensitive information. Ideally, the image should only contain the BIPED entry banner and the clicked button;
 Join META Publishing’s Discord server by clicking here;
 Head over to the #giveaway-lair channel and share your screenshot, alongside the platform you’d like to play BIPED on (PC, PlayStation, XBOX, or Nintendo Switch);
 Sit back and relax!

Winners will be drawn at random, from those that shared their screenshot, on December 21st, 2020. Keep an eye on Discord to catch the announcement and claim your prize!
